      <p>If StarsJoy fails to deliver the Stars or Premium you paid for (technical error, wrong username, etc.), that counts as a breach of its own service obligation — and the amount paid is <strong>refunded 100%</strong>. This is StarsJoy's own guarantee, separate from Telegram's "Stars are non-refundable" rule.</p>
    </div>
    <p>Full terms and step-by-step instructions are in <a href="/en/blog/is-buying-telegram-stars-safe">Is buying Telegram Stars safe? How to spot a scam</a>.</p>
  </section>

